 <section className="panel mt-5 p-5"><div className="flex items-center justify-between"><h3 className="text-sm font-semibold">A little guidance</h3><span className="text-[10px] text-[#929a95]">For your visit</span></div><div className="mt-4 flex gap-3"><div className="grid h-8 w-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#edf0ed] text-[#67766c]"><CircleAlert size={16}/></div><p className="text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#768079]">If you feel suddenly unwell while waiting, please tell a member of the hospital team right away.</p></div></section>
